@startuml ArtemusPark_Sequence_Diagram_IoT

!theme cerulean-outline
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

title Diagrama de Secuencia - Flujo IoT Automatico (Sensor -> BD -> UI)

actor "Sensor IoT" as Sensor
participant "MQTT\nBroker" as MQTT
participant "MQTT\nSubscriber" as Subscriber
participant "ReceiveSensorData\nUseCase" as ReceiveUC
participant "SensorService" as Service
participant "SensorRepository" as Repo
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Dashboard\nViewModel" as VM
participant "Dashboard\nView" as View

== 1. Recepcion de Datos ==

Sensor -> MQTT: Publicar: sensores/temperatura/temp_01
activate MQTT

MQTT -> Subscriber: Deliver message
activate Subscriber

Subscriber -> Subscriber: Parsear payload JSON
Subscriber -> Subscriber: Validar esquema

== 2. Procesamiento ==

Subscriber -> ReceiveUC: execute(payload)
activate ReceiveUC

ReceiveUC -> ReceiveUC: Enriquecer datos
ReceiveUC -> ReceiveUC: Agregar timestamp server

ReceiveUC -> Service: process_reading(data)
activate Service

Service -> Service: Validar rango valores
Service -> Service: Calcular status (normal/warning/critical)

== 3. Persistencia ==

Service -> Repo: create(reading)
activate Repo

Repo -> Repo: Mapear a row SQL
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO sensor_readings
activate DB

DB --> Repo: RETURNING id
Repo --> Service: reading_id

deactivate DB
deactivate Repo

Service -> Service: Evaluar alertas

opt Si es alerta
    Service -> Service: create_alert()
    Service -> Repo: save(alert)
    Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO alerts
end

Service --> ReceiveUC: SensorReading (con ID)
deactivate Service

ReceiveUC --> Subscriber: SensorReadingDTO

deactivate ReceiveUC

== 4. Actualizacion UI ==

Subscriber -> VM: add_reading(dto)
activate VM

VM -> VM: Actualizar estado observable
VM -> View: notify_update()
activate View

alt Es alerta
    View -> View: Mostrar banner ROJO
    View -> View: Sonido notificacion
else Normal
    View -> View: Actualizar grafico
    View -> View: Actualizar tabla
end

View --> VM: OK

deactivate View
deactivate VM

deactivate Subscriber
deactivate MQTT

== 5. Ciclo Continuo ==

Sensor -> Sensor: Sleep 5 segundos
Sensor -> MQTT: Siguiente medicion

@enduml
